  "Chapter 11 — The First Fight": "第十一章 — 第一次吵架",
  "After school. {her} is laughing at the edge of the field with a tall guy you have never met. Faris. He says something; she laughs harder.": "放学后。{her}在操场边，和一个你从没见过的高个子男生有说有笑。法里斯。他说了句什么，她笑得更厉害了。",
  "Why is she laughing like that? She never laughs like that at my jokes. ...Does she?": "她为什么笑成那样？我讲笑话时她从来不会那样笑。……会吗？",
  "After school. {her} is laughing at the edge of the field with a tall guy you have never met. Jun Hao. He says something; she laughs harder.": "放学后。{her}在操场边，和一个你从没见过的高个子男生有说有笑。俊豪。他说了句什么，她笑得更厉害了。",
  "After school. {her} is laughing at the edge of the field with a tall guy you have never met. Arvind. He says something; she laughs harder.": "放学后。{her}在操场边，和一个你从没见过的高个子男生有说有笑。阿尔文。他说了句什么，她笑得更厉害了。",
  "After school. {her} is laughing at the edge of the field with a tall guy you have never met. Leo. He says something; she laughs harder.": "放学后。{her}在操场边，和一个你从没见过的高个子男生有说有笑。里奥。他说了句什么，她笑得更厉害了。",
  "There it is. The green-eyed monster. Feeling it is normal. Feeding it is a choice.": "来了。绿眼怪兽。有这种感觉很正常。要不要喂养它，是你的选择。",
