  "Name it to yourself first. Later, calmly: \"I felt a bit jealous. Can I meet him?\"": "先在心里对自己说出这个感觉。之后再冷静地说：“我有点吃醋。我可以认识一下他吗？”",
  "Oh! That's Faris, her cousin. Come, I'll introduce you. Thank you for just saying it.": "哦！那是法里斯，她表哥。来，我介绍给你认识。谢谢你直接说出来。",
  "Faris shakes your hand and immediately complains about first-aid drills. He is extremely normal.": "法里斯跟你握了握手，马上开始抱怨急救演练。他是个非常普通的人。",
  "Oh! That's Jun Hao, her co-editor on the school magazine. Come, I'll introduce you. Thank you for just saying it.": "哦！那是俊豪，她在校刊的共同编辑。来，我介绍给你认识。谢谢你直接说出来。",
  "Jun Hao shakes your hand and immediately complains about the magazine layout. He is extremely normal.": "俊豪跟你握了握手，马上开始抱怨校刊的排版。他是个非常普通的人。",
  "Oh! That's Arvind, her relay training partner. Come, I'll introduce you. Thank you for just saying it.": "哦！那是阿尔文，她的接力训练搭档。来，我介绍给你认识。谢谢你直接说出来。",
  "Arvind shakes your hand and immediately complains about baton changes. He is extremely normal.": "阿尔文跟你握了握手，马上开始抱怨交接棒。他是个非常普通的人。",
  "Oh! That's Leo, her dance partner for the showcase. Come, I'll introduce you. Thank you for just saying it.": "哦！那是里奥，她在成果展上的舞伴。来，我介绍给你认识。谢谢你直接说出来。",
  "Leo shakes your hand and immediately complains about the lift in bar sixteen. He is extremely normal.": "里奥跟你握了握手，马上开始抱怨第十六小节的托举。他是个非常普通的人。",
