  "BAD END #12 — It Was Her Cousin": "BAD END #12 — 那是她表哥",
  "Jealousy tells a story fast, and the story is usually wrong. Feel it, name it to yourself, then ask calmly. A public confrontation humiliates her, her friend and you, and it shows her what your fear does when it is in charge.": "嫉妒编故事的速度很快，而且编出来的故事通常是错的。感受它，对自己说出来，然后冷静地问。当众质问会让她、她的朋友和你都很难堪，也会让她看到：当恐惧掌控你时，你会做出什么。",
