  "A cafe after class. {her} goes to the washroom. Her phone lights up on the table: \"Faris: about tomorrow…\"": "下课后的咖啡馆。{her}去了洗手间。她的手机在桌上亮了起来：“法里斯：关于明天……”",
  "A cafe after class. {her} goes to the washroom. Her phone lights up on the table: \"Jun Hao: about tomorrow…\"": "下课后的咖啡馆。{her}去了洗手间。她的手机在桌上亮了起来：“俊豪：关于明天……”",
  "A cafe after class. {her} goes to the washroom. Her phone lights up on the table: \"Arvind: about tomorrow…\"": "下课后的咖啡馆。{her}去了洗手间。她的手机在桌上亮了起来：“阿尔文：关于明天……”",
  "A cafe after class. {her} goes to the washroom. Her phone lights up on the table: \"Leo: about tomorrow…\"": "下课后的咖啡馆。{her}去了洗手间。她的手机在桌上亮了起来：“里奥：关于明天……”",
