  "Don't touch it. Turn it face down so you are not tempted.": "别碰。把手机翻过来盖着，免得自己忍不住。",
  "She comes back, glances at it and laughs. \"He wants to swap tomorrow's practice. Boring.\" You did not need to know. Now you know anyway.": "她回来了，瞄了一眼，笑了。“他想换明天的练习时间。好无聊。”你本来不需要知道。现在你还是知道了。",
