  "BAD END #13 — Trust.exe Has Stopped Working": "BAD END #13 — 信任.exe已停止运行",
  "Tracking a partner without consent is control, not care, and secretly installing spyware on someone's phone can be a crime. If you can't trust someone without watching them, the problem is not on their phone. Talk, or end it kindly.": "没经过同意就追踪伴侣，是控制，不是关心；偷偷在别人手机里装监控软件甚至可能触犯法律。如果你不盯着对方就无法信任她，问题不在她的手机里。好好沟通，或者温柔地结束。",
  "Alpha Kai 🔴 LIVE": "阿尔法·凯 🔴 直播中",
  "Real men know where their woman is 24/7. Make her share her location. If she has nothing to hide, she won't mind. 💯": "真男人24小时都知道自己的女人在哪里。让她分享定位。如果她没什么好隐瞒的，她就不会介意。💯",
