  "Close the video. Unfollow. Not interested.": "关掉视频。取消关注。没兴趣。",
  "A man selling \"how to own your girlfriend\" is selling you a lonelier life. Good riddance.": "一个推销“如何掌控你女朋友”的人，其实是在推销一种更孤独的人生。走了正好。",
  "Text her: \"Share your location. If you have nothing to hide…\"": "发信息给她：“分享你的定位。如果你没什么好隐瞒的……”",
  "did someone tell you to say that? because it doesn't sound like you.": "是有人叫你这样说的吗？因为这听起来不像你。",
  "\"Nothing to hide\" is how control dresses up as trust. Location sharing can be nice when both people freely want it. Demanded, it is a leash.": "“没什么好隐瞒的”是控制伪装成信任的说法。如果两个人都心甘情愿，分享定位可以很甜蜜。被要求的话，那就是一条狗绳。",
  "Ask Haziq. Then ask Uncle Ong.": "问问哈齐克。再问问王伯。",
  "do it bro. alpha moves 😤": "做啊兄弟。阿尔法操作😤",
  "My ex-wife and I tracked each other for a year. Very accurate. We knew where the other person was every minute and had no idea who they were any more. Don't.": "我和我前妻互相追踪了一年。非常准确。我们每分钟都知道对方在哪里，却再也不知道对方是谁了。别这样做。",
  "Can I ask something? Who's Rae? And Elise? Why do you still text them?": "我可以问一件事吗？瑞儿是谁？还有伊莉丝？你为什么还在跟她们发信息？",
  "She saw the names on your screen.": "她看到了你屏幕上的名字。",
  "Open and honest. Tell her who they are, and offer to show the chats if she wants.": "坦白诚实。告诉她她们是谁，如果她想看，就把聊天记录给她看。",
  "I don't need to read them. I just needed you to not get weird about it. Thanks.": "我不需要看。我只是需要你别因为这样就变得怪怪的。谢谢。",
  "\"Why are you checking on me? Don't you trust me?\"": "“你为什么要查我？你不信任我吗？”",
  "I asked one question. Last week you were upset about one guy I study with. Funny how that works.": "我只是问了一个问题。上星期你还为了一个跟我一起读书的男生不高兴。真有意思。",
  "The rules you want for her are the rules you have to live by. Otherwise it is not a rule. It is a double standard.": "你想给她定的规矩，就是你自己也要遵守的规矩。不然那就不是规矩，是双重标准。",
  "Your maths test comes back. 38 out of 100. Ten minutes later, the class group chat explodes.": "你的数学考卷发回来了。100分里只拿了38分。十分钟后，班级群炸开了锅。",
  "Hanis's team came first at the national first-aid competition.": "哈妮丝的队伍在全国急救比赛中拿了第一名。",
