  "Your advice nearly started a fight in a bubble tea shop. Jealousy needs a calm voice, not a bodyguard.": "你的建议差点让一家奶茶店里打起来。嫉妒需要的是冷静的声音，不是保镖。",
  "Also. When she was in the toilet I saw her phone light up. Should I check it next time? Kai says make her share location 24/7.": "还有。她上厕所的时候我看到她手机亮了。下次我要不要偷看一下？凯说要让她24小时分享定位。",
